{
"#name"
:
{
"fresh"
:
null
,
"zh"
:
"终端文本编辑器（多光标 + LSP）"
,
"en"
:
"Terminal text editor (multi-cursor + LSP)"
}
,
"#synopsis"
:
[
{
"x fresh [OPTIONS] [FILES]..."
:
null
}
,
{
"x fresh --cmd <subcmd> [args]"
:
null
}
]
,
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"多光标 + LSP + 会话 + 插件的现代终端文本编辑器；x-cmd 自动安装并管理 PATH，支持本地与 SSH 远程编辑"
,
"en"
:
"Modern terminal text editor with multi-cursor editing, LSP, sessions, and plugins; x-cmd auto-installs and manages PATH, supports local and SSH remote editing"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"zh"
:
"首次调用若未安装 fresh CLI，模块自动通过 x eget 从上游下载到 ~/.local/bin（x-cmd 自动加入 PATH），然后透传给 fresh。\n"
,
"en"
:
"On first call, if the fresh CLI is missing, the module auto-installs from upstream via x eget to ~/.local/bin (x-cmd adds it to PATH automatically), then transparently delegates to fresh.\n"
}
,
{
"zh"
:
"文件定位语法（也可作为 `x fresh --cmd session open-file` 的第二个参数起）：\n  file.txt:10               在第 10 行打开\n  file.txt:10:5             在第 10 行第 5 列打开\n  file.txt:10-20            选中第 10-20 行\n  file.txt:10@\"msg\"         打开并显示 markdown 弹窗\n为避免 shell 展开含 @ 的语法，文件参数用单引号包裹。\n"
,
"en"
:
"File location syntax (also works from the 2nd arg of `x fresh --cmd session open-file`):\n  file.txt:10               Open at line 10\n  file.txt:10:5             Open at line 10, column 5\n  file.txt:10-20            Select lines 10-20\n  file.txt:10@\"msg\"         Open with a markdown popup\nWrap file args in single quotes to avoid shell expansion of @.\n"
}
,
{
"zh"
:
"--wait 适合脚本/AI Agent 引导式审阅：x fresh --cmd session open-file . 'src/main.rs:10-25@\"msg\"' --wait\n加 --wait 后 CLI 阻塞到用户关闭弹窗（@msg 时）或关闭 buffer（无 msg 时），方便依次打开多个位置。\n用作 git 的编辑器：git config core.editor 'x fresh --cmd session open-file . --wait'\n"
,
"en"
:
"--wait is for scripted/agent-driven review: x fresh --cmd session open-file . 'src/main.rs:10-25@\"msg\"' --wait\nWith --wait, the CLI blocks until the user dismisses the popup (@msg) or closes the buffer, ideal for walking through multiple locations.\nUse as git's editor: git config core.editor 'x fresh --cmd session open-file . --wait'\n"
}
,
{
"zh"
:
"远程编辑支持两种形式（文件/终端/LSP 全部跑在远端）：\n  URL 形式: x fresh ssh://[user@]host[:port]/path[:line[:col]]\n  scp 形式: x fresh user@host:path[:line[:col]]\n"
,
"en"
:
"Remote editing supports two forms (file, terminal, and LSP all run on the remote host):\n  URL form: x fresh ssh://[user@]host[:port]/path[:line[:col]]\n  scp form: x fresh user@host:path[:line[:col]]\n"
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x fresh file.txt"
,
"zh"
:
"示例: 在当前目录打开文件（最常用）"
,
"en"
:
"Example: open a file in the current directory (most common)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x fresh 'main.rs:42'"
,
"zh"
:
"示例: 打开文件并跳到第 42 行"
,
"en"
:
"Example: open a file and jump to line 42"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x fresh 'main.rs:42-80@\"check this block\"'"
,
"zh"
:
"示例: 选中 42-80 行并显示 markdown 弹窗（脚本引导式审阅）"
,
"en"
:
"Example: select lines 42-80 with a markdown popup (scripted review)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x fresh --cmd session open-file . 'src/main.rs:10-25@\"msg\"' --wait"
,
"zh"
:
"示例: 在当前目录的 session 中引导用户审阅 10-25 行"
,
"en"
:
"Example: walk the user through lines 10-25 in the current-directory session"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x fresh -a"
,
"zh"
:
"示例: 附加到当前目录的 session（跨终端共享编辑状态）"
,
"en"
:
"Example: attach to the current-directory session (share state across terminals)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x fresh -a mysession"
,
"zh"
:
"示例: 附加到名为 mysession 的 session"
,
"en"
:
"Example: attach to a session named mysession"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x fresh --cmd session new proj"
,
"zh"
:
"示例: 启动名为 proj 的新 session"
,
"en"
:
"Example: start a new session named proj"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x fresh --cmd session list"
,
"zh"
:
"示例: 列出所有活跃的 session"
,
"en"
:
"Example: list all active sessions"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x fresh --cmd config show"
,
"zh"
:
"示例: 打印当前生效的配置"
,
"en"
:
"Example: print the effective configuration"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x fresh --cmd config paths"
,
"zh"
:
"示例: 查看 fresh 使用的目录（配置/插件/会话等）"
,
"en"
:
"Example: show directories used by fresh (config, plugins, sessions, etc.)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x fresh --cmd grammar list"
,
"zh"
:
"示例: 列出所有可用的语法高亮（带来源信息）"
,
"en"
:
"Example: list all available grammars (with source info)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x fresh --cmd init"
,
"zh"
:
"示例: 初始化新插件 / 主题 / 语言模板"
,
"en"
:
"Example: initialize a new plugin / theme / language"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x fresh user@host:src/main.rs"
,
"zh"
:
"示例: 通过 SSH 远程编辑文件（文件/终端/LSP 都在远端）"
,
"en"
:
"Example: edit a file over SSH (file, terminal, and LSP all on the remote host)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x fresh ssh://user@host:2222/path/to/file.rs:100"
,
"zh"
:
"示例: URL 形式 SSH 编辑远端第 100 行"
,
"en"
:
"Example: SSH-edit a remote file at line 100 via URL form"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x fresh --safe"
,
"zh"
:
"示例: 安全模式启动（跳过 init.ts 和所有插件，用于坏配置恢复）"
,
"en"
:
"Example: safe mode (skip init.ts and all plugins, for bad-config recovery)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x fresh --locale zh-CN"
,
"zh"
:
"示例: 用中文界面启动（支持 en / es / fr / ja / zh-CN 等）"
,
"en"
:
"Example: launch with Chinese UI (supports en, es, fr, ja, zh-CN, etc.)"
}
]
,
"#subcmd:editor"
:
[
"session"
,
"config"
,
"grammar"
,
"init"
]
,
"session"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"会话管理 —— 跨终端共享同一编辑状态，支持远程打开/引导式审阅"
,
"en"
:
"Session management — share editing state across terminals, supports remote open-file and guided review"
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x fresh -a"
,
"zh"
:
"示例: 附加到当前目录的 session"
,
"en"
:
"Example: attach to the current-directory session"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x fresh --cmd session new proj"
,
"zh"
:
"示例: 启动新 session proj"
,
"en"
:
"Example: start a new session proj"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x fresh --cmd session list"
,
"zh"
:
"示例: 列出所有活跃的 session"
,
"en"
:
"Example: list active sessions"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x fresh --cmd session open-file . 'main.rs:1-10@\"step 1\"' --wait"
,
"zh"
:
"示例: 引导式审阅 1-10 行（脚本/AI Agent 流程）"
,
"en"
:
"Example: guided review of lines 1-10 (scripted/agent workflow)"
}
]
}
,
"new"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"启动一个新的命名 session"
,
"en"
:
"Start a new named session"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"session 名"
,
"en"
:
"Session name"
}
}
}
,
"attach"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"附加到指定 session（. 或省略表示当前目录的 session）"
,
"en"
:
"Attach to a session (. or omit for the current-directory session)"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"session 名（省略或 . 表示当前目录的 session）"
,
"en"
:
"Session name (omit or use . for the current-directory session)"
}
}
}
,
"list"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"列出所有活跃的 session"
,
"en"
:
"List all active sessions"
}
}
,
"kill"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"终止一个 session"
,
"en"
:
"Terminate a session"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"session 名（省略表示当前目录的 session）"
,
"en"
:
"Session name (omit for the current-directory session)"
}
}
}
,
"open-file"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"在指定 session 中打开文件，可加 --wait 阻塞等待关闭"
,
"en"
:
"Open files in a session; add --wait to block until closed"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"session 名（. 表示当前目录的 session；不存在则自动创建）"
,
"en"
:
"Session name (. for current-directory session; auto-created if missing)"
}
}
,
"#n"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"要打开的文件，支持 file:line:col / range / @\"msg\" 语法"
,
"en"
:
"Files to open, with file:line:col / range / @msg syntax"
}
}
,
"--wait"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"阻塞 CLI 直到用户关闭弹窗（@msg 时）或关闭 buffer"
,
"en"
:
"Block the CLI until the user dismisses the popup (@msg) or closes the buffer"
}
}
}
,
"config"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"查看 fresh 的配置（show 打印有效配置，paths 列出目录）"
,
"en"
:
"Inspect fresh's config (show prints effective config, paths shows directories)"
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x fresh --cmd config show"
,
"zh"
:
"示例: 打印当前生效的配置"
,
"en"
:
"Example: print the effective configuration"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x fresh --cmd config paths"
,
"zh"
:
"示例: 查看 fresh 使用的目录"
,
"en"
:
"Example: show directories used by fresh"
}
]
}
,
"grammar"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"列出所有可用的语法高亮"
,
"en"
:
"List all available grammars"
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x fresh --cmd grammar list"
,
"zh"
:
"示例: 列出所有可用语法高亮（带来源信息）"
,
"en"
:
"Example: list all available grammars (with source info)"
}
]
}
,
"init"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"初始化新插件 / 主题 / 语言模板"
,
"en"
:
"Initialize a new plugin / theme / language"
}
}
}

